Bound nested CTerm macro expansion (upstream: mkrueger/icy_tools#197, commit fc5b8b55).

Macros that invoke each other multiplied their output at every level: about
110 bytes of definitions hung the tab. Each top-level invocation gets a budget
of expanded bytes (4 x MAX_MACRO_LEN) that nested invocations draw from; the
rest is dropped once it runs out.

